{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/fabcd5283c830b9c860d37ddfbe4fa0f.poster.avif?t=1767872065\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/fabcd5283c830b9c860d37ddfbe4fa0f.webm?t=1767872065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/fabcd5283c830b9c860d37ddfbe4fa0f.mp4?t=1767872065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A brutal beer pong game where losers are getting electrocuted. </strong><br><br><strong>A skill-based challenge set in an underground bar full of illegal, deadly matches.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into a place where no one plays for fun.<br>A metal collar tightens around your neck, audience whispers, and every throw can end in victory\u2026 or voltage.<br>Here, there are no draws \u2014 <strong>only winners or dead bodies.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Amaze with your throws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your throws direct, or use your skills with bouncing.<br>The riskier the shot, the more money you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/c11c6c89a38cedc1d4007df90c765262.poster.avif?t=1767872065\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/c11c6c89a38cedc1d4007df90c765262.webm?t=1767872065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/c11c6c89a38cedc1d4007df90c765262.mp4?t=1767872065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deadly 3-round duels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is split into three rounds.<br>Every round ends with someone being electrocuted \u2014 you or your opponent.<br>You get three chances\u2026 unless you dare to play for more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drunken buffs &amp; debuffs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds Gustav serves special drinks that might:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiply your income,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sabotage your opponent,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >turn fate of the match upsite down, and more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/9a15986aa601f8a13b27b7f14babd970.poster.avif?t=1767872065\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/9a15986aa601f8a13b27b7f14babd970.webm?t=1767872065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132010/extras/9a15986aa601f8a13b27b7f14babd970.mp4?t=1767872065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> \u2013 practice your shots and earn small cash rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong> \u2013 high stakes, real tension, real pain.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysteries beneath the bar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place hides secrets.<br>The question is: <strong>do you want to uncover them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http